{
  "name": "CRM 新建企业自动补全联系人 (HubSpot / Pipedrive)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 实时 CRM 企业信息补全\n\n当 HubSpot 或 Pipedrive 创建新企业时自动触发，提取官网域名，抓取企业电话与邮箱并更新回 CRM 属性。\n\n## 配置（仅需一次）\n\n**1. 获取 Apify Token** — https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations\n\n**2. 创建 n8n 凭据**\n凭据 → 新建 → **Header Auth**\n- 名称: `Apify API`\n- Header name: `Authorization`\n- Header value: `Bearer 你的_APIFY_TOKEN`\n\n所有 HTTP 节点均已配置指向该凭据，工作流文件中不包含任何密钥。\n\n## 计费说明\n\n按事件付费：成功找到联系方式（邮箱或电话）的域名每个 $0.006（Gold 阶梯低至 $0.003，千个起价 $3.00）。被拦截、无法访问或无联系信息的域名完全免费。\n\n当前价格详情：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/website-contact-finder/pricing\n\nActor 页面：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/website-contact-finder\n模板与开源仓库：https://github.com/sumitrmardy/website-contact-finder-api",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "t2-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "event": "company.created",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t2-trigger",
      "name": "新建企业触发器",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspotTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        320,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sumitr_mardy~website-contact-finder/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ domains: [ $json.properties && $json.properties.domain ? $json.properties.domain.value : $json.domain ] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        }
      },
      "id": "t2-find",
      "name": "查询联系方式 (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify-api",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "149c2e0f-7818-497a-9ee6-d955bcd22595",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "contacts_found",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t2-filter",
      "name": "过滤有结果的企业",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "company",
        "operation": "update",
        "companyId": "={{ $('New Company Created').item.json.objectId || $('New Company Created').item.json.id }}",
        "updateFields": {
          "customPropertiesUi": {
            "customPropertiesValues": [
              {
                "property": "phone",
                "value": "={{ ($json.phones && $json.phones[0] && ($json.phones[0].e164 || $json.phones[0].raw)) || '' }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "t2-update-crm",
      "name": "更新企业资料至 CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "新建企业触发器": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "查询联系方式 (Apify)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "查询联系方式 (Apify)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "过滤有结果的企业",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "过滤有结果的企业": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "更新企业资料至 CRM",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
